{"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites","text":"Prerequisites","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate","text":"Embed the Certificate","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","text":"Fetch a Session Token","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Perform a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST"},{"type":"text","text":" request to the following endpoint:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"URL:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Headers:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Content-Type: application\/json"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Body:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["{","    \"allowOrigin\": \"https:\/\/www.adyen.com\",","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"],"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The required ","type":"text"},{"code":"roles","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Import-the-SDK","text":"Import the SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This gives you access to all public types, including ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Configuration"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProvisioningSession"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not import ","type":"text"},{"code":"IssuingCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider","text":"Implement a Token Provider","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements","text":"Device Testing Requirements","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Release build on a physical device","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Next-Steps","text":"Next Steps","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardProvisioningGuide","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/SessionsProvisioningGuide","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/OfflineProvisioningGuide","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Reveal card details, reveal PIN, change PIN (Work in Progress)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions/documentation/CardProvisioningSessions/CardSessionsGuide":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Securely reveal card details, reveal PINs, and change PINs."}],"identifier":"